                              <div class="centered_text whispering_mist sixfold_vertical_padding twentyfold_horizontal_padding double_xl_curves">
                                    <h1 class="quadruple_xl_text strong_signature close_tracking darkest_grey_text small_six_xl_text">Interiors shaped around the way you live</h1>
                                    <p class="top_margin_of_six large_font_style eightfold_lead shadowed_grey_text">
                                          Blue Door Interiors explores the possibilities of home interior design, bringing together practical layouts, considered colour choices and materials that feel right for the people who live with them. A successful room is more than a collection of attractive pieces: it should make sense in everyday use and feel connected to the wider home. Whether you are rethinking one room or considering a broader refresh, the first step is to understand what matters to
                                          you, how the space is used and what you would like it to become. From there, design decisions can be approached with clarity, care and a consistent point of view. Our website shares ideas and information about creating individual, comfortable interiors across England.
                                    </p>
                                    <div class="top_margin_of_ten flexibility_unbound core_of_elements balance_of_harmony horizontal_gap_of_six">
                                          <a href="#" class="complete_circle bg--600 three_and_half_padding two_and_half_vertical_padding small_breeze emphasized_type pure_white_text subtle_shadow hover:bg--500 visible_focus_outline double_visible_focus_outline offset_visible_focus_with_two focus-visible:outline--600"></a>
                                    </div>
                              </div>
                        </div>
                  </div>
