                                          <div class="expanding_spirit left_padding_of_half_a_dozen">
                                                <h2 class="darkest_grey_text large_font_style title-font balanced_style bottom_margin_of_two">A coherent use of colour</h2>
                                                <p class="calm_flow foundational_text">
                                                      Colour can influence the mood of a room and affect how its finishes, furnishings and natural light appear together. Rather than selecting shades in isolation, it helps to look at the whole palette and consider how it changes from one part of the home to another. The existing architecture, the direction of light and the atmosphere you want to create can all inform a balanced choice. Blue Door Interiors treats colour as one part of a wider
                                                      design story, helping ideas feel connected without requiring every room to look the same.
                                                </p>
                                          </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="fourfold_padding medium_width_of_third flexibility_unbound">
