                                          <div class="expanding_spirit left_padding_of_half_a_dozen">
                                                <h2 class="darkest_grey_text large_font_style title-font balanced_style bottom_margin_of_two">Materials with character</h2>
                                                <p class="calm_flow foundational_text">
                                                      Surfaces and fabrics contribute texture, warmth and visual depth to an interior. Their appearance can shift with daylight, surrounding colours and the way a room is used, so it is valuable to consider them in context rather than as isolated samples. A thoughtful mix can bring contrast while keeping a space harmonious, and practical considerations can sit alongside aesthetic preferences. Blue Door Interiors encourages a deliberate approach to
                                                      material choices, with attention to how finishes relate to the home and to the atmosphere its occupants want to create.
                                                </p>
