                                    <h2 class="triple_xl_text strong_signature close_tracking darkest_grey_text small_quad_xl_text">A thoughtful design journey</h2>
                                    <p class="top_margin_of_six large_font_style eightfold_lead shadowed_grey_text">Good interior design begins with listening and observation. Understanding how a home is used, what its occupants value and which parts of the space feel unresolved can help set a meaningful direction. These foundations make it easier to discuss layout, colour and materials in relation to everyday life.</p>
                                    <p class="top_margin_of_six large_font_style eightfold_lead shadowed_grey_text">
                                          There is no single formula for a welcoming home. Each room has its own light, proportions and practical demands, and every household brings different routines and preferences. Blue Door Interiors focuses on the design considerations that can help connect those details, offering a clear way to explore possibilities while keeping personal character and real-life use in view. The numbered items below describe stages of a design conversation, not company
                                          performance figures or guaranteed outcomes.
                                    </p>
